# Drop product and hero photography here.
#
# Reference it from a template with a link expression, never a relative path:
#   <img th:src="@{/images/torta-violeta.jpg}" alt="...">
#
# For catalog products, set Product.img to "/images/<file>.jpg" - product/list.html
# and product/detail.html render it when present and fall back to a palette tile
# when it is null or empty.
